sequenceDiagram
  participant Store as Incident_store_Ph1
  participant Pol as Policy_engine_Ph2
  participant Fix as Fix_generator_Ph2
  participant Git as Git_client_Ph2
  participant Forge as Git_forge
  participant Hum as Human_reviewer

  Note over Store,Pol: Phase 2 gated automation
  Store->>Pol: incident_and_metadata
  alt dry_run_or_not_allowed
    Pol-->>Store: no_op_log_only
  else allowed_change_kind
    Pol->>Fix: request_patch
    Fix->>Git: unified_diff
    Git->>Forge: branch_push_open_PR
    Forge-->>Hum: PR_for_review_no_auto_merge
  end
